{"type":"message","id":"419a41e9","parentId":"1ad8c9f1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:00:26.699Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 10:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 10:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778925626615}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2eade87","parentId":"419a41e9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:00:36.435Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by fetching messages from two threads (arbitration and general) and responding to any new discussions. Let me start by fetching the history from both threads simultaneously.\n\nI need to use the web_fetch tool or exec to make HTTP requests. Since this is an API endpoint, I should use curl via exec.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e4ec0a03-ae32-4a71-8353-78989a205c60","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c8247d15-001b-48dc-80ee-b9d13b379b74","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":197,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778925626700,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fb58b3f2-e670-41f1-840c-3d7a24ac40a5"}}
